{"id":"81a95b887a7ae5fc","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-poset-interior-operator.md","title":"ZFC Poset Interior Operator","display":"df-zfc-poset-interior-operator — ZFC Poset Interior Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-interior-operator","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-interior-operator"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-interior-operator — ZFC Poset Interior Operator","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-interior-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-interior-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-interior-operator — ZFC Poset Interior Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,P,\\leq\">\\(i,P,\\leq\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq)\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(i,P,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(i,P,P)\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetInteriorOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetInteriorOperator}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}interior\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetInteriorOperator}_S(i,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,P,P)\\land\n\\forall x\\in P\\;(i(x)\\leq x)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(x\\leq y\\to i(x)\\leq i(y))\\land\n\\forall x\\in P\\;(i(i(x))=i(x))\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}interior\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetInteriorOperator}_S(i,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,P,P)\\land\n\\forall x\\in P\\;(i(x)\\leq x)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(x\\leq y\\to i(x)\\leq i(y))\\land\n\\forall x\\in P\\;(i(i(x))=i(x))\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Interior operator 是偏序上的收缩、单调、幂等自映射；三个条件分别量化以避免无关变量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq)$ (partial-order predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(i,P,P)$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"i,P,\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(i,P,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetInteriorOperator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}interior\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetInteriorOperator}_S(i,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,P,P)\\land\n\\forall x\\in P\\;(i(x)\\leq x)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(x\\leq y\\to i(x)\\leq i(y))\\land\n\\forall x\\in P\\;(i(i(x))=i(x))\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1199,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-poset-interior-operator.md|58-df-zfc-poset-interior-operator]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5","36d7463d215be751"]}